# Copy to .env for local development. Both values are public (the anon key is
# protected by RLS, not by secrecy) -- find them in the Supabase dashboard under
# Project Settings > API.
#
# On Vercel, the Supabase integration provides SUPABASE_URL / SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
# instead; vite.config.ts accepts either name.
#
# NEVER put the service_role / secret key here or in any VITE_ variable.
